{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>A <strong>dungeon crawler where luck is your only weapon</strong>.</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every action, every event, every discovery is determined by... a <strong>slot machine</strong>. Dive into a <strong>procedurally generated dungeon</strong>, explore its mysterious depths, and let fate pull the strings of your adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attack, defend, loot, trade, or flee \u2014 <strong>it all depends on the spin</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An unpredictable dungeon crawler</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every action is handled through a <strong>one-armed bandit</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's not just luck \u2014 <strong>try to stop the reels at the right moment</strong> to trigger favorable outcomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combine symbols</strong> to unleash powerful effects\u2026 or devastating disasters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adapt your strategy</strong> based on the spins and the artifacts you unlock along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spend energy</strong> to re-spin certain reels and try to improve your results.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What to expect?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally generated maps</strong> \u2014 no dungeon is ever the same</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Varied weapons, powerful items, and incredible artifacts</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple playable classes</strong>, each with their own unique twists</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Goblins, skeletons, bandits, ghosts, dragons\u2026 and much worse</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mysterious chests, shops, unexpected blessings or curses</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modify probabilities</strong>, rig your luck\u2026 or suffer the consequences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Permadeath</strong> \u2014 every run is a unique attempt to go deeper than ever before</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Pereelous</strong>, luck is your weapon.<br><strong>Will you twist fate to your advantage\u2026 or become its eternal plaything?</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3719900?t=1759397520","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3719900?t=1759397520","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719900/4fd6039d93f9e4663bac4035558af4dafe4a1280/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759397520","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719900/4fd6039d93f9e4663bac4035558af4dafe4a1280/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759397520","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>A <strong>dungeon crawler where luck is your only weapon</strong>.</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every action, every event, every discovery is determined by... a <strong>slot machine</strong>. Dive into a <strong>procedurally generated dungeon</strong>, explore its mysterious depths, and let fate pull the strings of your adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attack, defend, loot, trade, or flee \u2014 <strong>it all depends on the spin</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An unpredictable dungeon crawler</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every action is handled through a <strong>one-armed bandit</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's not just luck \u2014 <strong>try to stop the reels at the right moment</strong> to trigger favorable outcomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combine symbols</strong> to unleash powerful effects\u2026 or devastating disasters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adapt your strategy</strong> based on the spins and the artifacts you unlock along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spend energy</strong> to re-spin certain reels and try to improve your results.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What to expect?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally generated maps</strong> \u2014 no dungeon is ever the same</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Varied weapons, powerful items, and incredible artifacts</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple playable classes</strong>, each with their own unique twists</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Goblins, skeletons, bandits, ghosts, dragons\u2026 and much worse</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mysterious chests, shops, unexpected blessings or curses</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modify probabilities</strong>, rig your luck\u2026 or suffer the consequences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Permadeath</strong> \u2014 every run is a unique attempt to go deeper than ever before</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Pereelous</strong>, luck is your weapon.<br><strong>Will you twist fate to your advantage\u2026 or become its eternal plaything?</strong></p>","developers":["VANDERMAESEN GAMES"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719900/8cffed8fa22b5d9bafdf1bdacf982902d5657c30/header.jpg?t=1759397520","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3719900/88243935/11653e209ad0acd7982bb9047ad443dd81da06f